msgstr "Montre modèl sove pou:"

#: src/main.ui:137
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Glasses, a change of facial hair or "
"different lighting change how your face looks to the camera, so a single "
"model can fail (for example in the evening under lamps). Add a second model "
"with glasses on or off, your other look, or in different light to keep "
"unlocking reliable."
msgstr ""
"Se yon sèl modèl figi ki enskri. Linèt, yon chanjman nan bab oswa yon limyè "
"diferan chanje jan kamera a wè figi ou, kidonk yon sèl modèl ka echwe (pa "
"egzanp nan aswè anba lanp). Ajoute yon dezyèm modèl ak linèt oswa san linèt, "
"lòt aparans ou a, oswa nan yon lòt limyè pou deblokaj la rete fyab."

#: src/main.ui:146
msgid "Add a second model"
msgstr "Ajoute yon dezyèm modèl"

