#: src/main.ui:445
msgid ""
"A desktop notification shows while Ubuntu Hello looks for your face, then "
"reports the result. Failed attempts stay in the notification list."
msgstr ""
"Yon notifikasyon sou biwo a parèt pandan Ubuntu Hello kap chèche figi ou, "
"epi li rapòte rezilta a. Tantativ ki echwe yo rete nan lis notifikasyon an."

#: src/main.ui:476
msgid "Show notifications"
msgstr "Montre notifikasyon"

#: src/main.ui:482
msgid ""
"One card per face-authentication attempt, updated in place with the result."
msgstr ""
"Yon kat pou chak tantativ otantifikasyon figi, mete ajou an plas ak rezilta "
"a."

#: src/main.ui:513
msgid "Notification sounds"
msgstr "Son notifikasyon"

#: src/main.ui:519
msgid "Play the system sound for a recognized or failed attempt."
msgstr "Jwe son sistèm lan pou yon tantativ rekonèt oswa echwe."

#: src/main.ui:550
msgid "Include diagnostics"
msgstr "Mete dyagnostik"

#: src/main.ui:556
msgid ""
"Add the model, certainty vs. threshold, frames, camera and timing to each "
"card. Useful when reporting a problem."
msgstr ""
"Ajoute modèl la, sètitid kont papòt, ankadreman, kamera ak distribisyon nan "
"chak kat. Li itil lè w rapòte yon pwoblèm."

#: src/main.ui:618 src/main.ui:734
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Sekirite"

#: src/main.ui:633
msgid ""
"How closely your face has to match, and whether Ubuntu Hello asks you to "
"confirm that you are really there."
msgstr ""
"Ki nivo resanblans figi ou dwe genyen, epi si Ubuntu Hello mande ou konfime "
"se vrèman ou ki la."

#: src/main.ui:657
msgid "Face match strictness"
msgstr "Nivo egzijans pou match figi a"

