#: src/main.ui:702 src/onboarding.ui:250
msgid "Ask me to nod to confirm"
msgstr "Mande m souke tèt mwen pou konfime"

#: src/main.ui:708 src/onboarding.ui:259
msgid ""
"After your face matches, a notification asks you to nod. A photo held up to "
"the camera cannot nod."
msgstr ""
"Apre figi ou fin matche, yon notifikasyon mande ou souke tèt ou. Yon foto yo "
"lonje devan kamera a pa kapab souke tèt li."

#: src/main.ui:771 src/onboarding.ui:759
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Debloke"

#: src/main.ui:786
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring or "
"KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the TPM when "
"available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only master key. Face "
"auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwallet5 depending on "
"your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Aktive otantifikasyon figi pou debloke otomatikman keyring koneksyon w lan "
"oswa KWallet lè w konekte. Sa a sere modpas ou an sekirite — sele nan TPM a "
"lè l disponib, oswa chifre ak AES-256-GCM avèk yon kle prensipal ke sèlman "
"root ka itilize. Otantifikasyon figi a mete PAM_AUTHTOK pou "
"pam_gnome_keyring oswa pam_kwallet5, selon biwo w la."

